Source common.tape
Output blocks.gif
Output blocks.mp4
Output blocks.webm

Hide
Type "cd $HOME_DEMO_WORK &&  clear" Enter
Sleep 800ms
Show

Type "navig block show safe-deployment" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 4s
Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "navig apply safe-deployment --dry-run" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 6s
